nostr:
Nostr WoT's stable SDK packages now separate derived passkeys from passkeys that protect an existing key or vault.

@nostr-wot/identity 1.1.0 and nostr-wot-sdk 3.0.1 are live on npm's latest tag. Unknown legacy credentials return an ambiguous result instead of being guessed. Provider overwrites need inspection and consent. Relay recovery is explicit.

The release also supports Nosskey backups and a provider signer with pinned window, origin and account checks.

